{
  "formatVersion": 2,
  "title": "Air quality: CO₂ and humidity control",
  "description": "A room sensor sends temperature, relative humidity, and CO₂. Its step controller converts the CO₂ concentration into a ventilation control value (0, 33, 66, or 100 %) for the fan connected to a dimming actuator. Above 1500 ppm it also sets a CO₂ alarm, shown on the alarm display. Enter values in the sensor fields to follow the telegrams.",
